"endpoint the key came from; ``:`` is replaced with ``_`` so IPv6 literals"
" are safe on every platform, including Windows)."
msgstr ""
"从服务器接收到的公钥以“server_<ip>_<port>.pem”形式缓存在“network_api/.Flow/pub_key”中（密钥来自的服务器端点；“:”被替换为“_”，因此"
" IPv6 文字在每个平台上都是安全的，包括 Windows）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:300
#: a7f009afaa9042809c49ad4dbdbad8ba
msgid "Anti-MITM identity check (TOFU)"
msgstr "反 MITM 身份检查 (TOFU)"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:302
#: bb60db87c6af48a19fbcb98813b6ae53
msgid ""
"Every connection re-exchanges public keys in plaintext, and each side "
"records the peer in ``network_api/.Flow/pub_key/pub_key.json``: the key "
"is ``(ip, port)`` (a Python tuple of the endpoint the peer is reachable "
"at), the value is ``[<sha256 of the public key>, <public key PEM>]``."
msgstr ""
"每个连接都以明文形式重新交换公钥，并且每一方都会在“network_api/.Flow/pub_key/pub_key.json”中记录对等点：密钥是“(ip,"
" port)”（对等点可到达的端点的 Python 元组），值是“[<公钥的 sha256>, <公钥 PEM>]”。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:307
#: ac91503b9df6420c99120dd738b62bc7
msgid ""
"First connection from an endpoint: the key is recorded and trusted (trust"
" on first use)."
msgstr "来自端点的首次连接：密钥被记录并受信任（首次使用时信任）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:309
#: 3257f69697ff42a0bb81e59d9f603cb5
msgid ""
"Later connection presenting the *same* key: accepted. If the endpoint "
"changed (dynamic IP / user-changed port) the record is moved to the new "
"``(ip, port)`` instead of being duplicated."
msgstr "稍后的连接显示*相同*密钥：已接受。如果端点更改（动态 IP / 用户更改的端口），记录将移动到新的“（ip，端口）”而不是重复。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:312
#: 0b87107d0e66464989bb4e1ab496c9d7
msgid ""
"Later connection presenting a *different* key for an already-recorded "
"endpoint: the connection is rejected (``/crypto_reject`` is received and "
"the client closes)."
msgstr "稍后的连接为已记录的端点提供*不同的*密钥：连接被拒绝（收到“/crypto_reject”并且客户端关闭）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:316
#: f31b796c6ce547ad8162407cc5e7ac9c
msgid ""
"The client-side record is keyed by the fixed server address, so a server "
"that changes its public key (for example a MITM substitution) is always "
"rejected on later connections. To reset trust (rotated keys, new server),"
" delete the ``pub_key.json`` entry (or the whole file)."
msgstr ""
"客户端记录由固定服务器地址作为密钥，因此更改其公钥（例如 MITM "
"替换）的服务器在以后的连接中始终会被拒绝。要重置信任（轮换密钥、新服务器），请删除“pub_key.json”条目（或整个文件）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:322
#: 39edccc5328d42cdbe2355b850342057
msgid "Handshake"
msgstr "握手"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:324
#: 758b41ffc85848d98b99833f3406b89b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The client sends a plaintext ``/crypto_key_exchange <client-nonce>`` "
"greeting right after connecting; the server replies with "
"``/crypto_key_exchange_ack <server-nonce> <need-client-pub> <force>``. "
"Both sides then push their public key files over the file-transfer "
"mechanism (plaintext) and TOFU-check the received key. Both sides switch "
"to encrypted mode only after ``/crypto_ready`` has been received from the"
" peer (so plaintext and ciphertext never interleave on a connection). On "
"later connections the keys are re-exchanged and TOFU-checked again; the "
"exchange is never skipped, only the identity check short-circuits for "
"known keys. Public-key pushes are only accepted while a handshake is in "
"progress, so an arbitrary unauthenticated server cannot poison the "
"registry."
msgstr ""
"客户端在连接后立即发送明文“/crypto_key_exchange”问候语；服务器回复``/crypto_key_exchange_ack "
"<need-client-pub> "
"<force>``。然后，双方通过文件传输机制（明文）推送其公钥文件，并对收到的密钥进行豆腐式检查。只有在从对等方收到“/crypto_ready”后，双方才会切换到加密模式（因此明文和密文永远不会在连接上交错）。在以后的连接中，密钥将被重新交换并再次进行"
" TOFU 检查；交换永远不会被跳过，只有已知密钥的身份检查会短路。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:338
#: ae31d53157b4449199a0d6a0ad9e1b63
msgid "Replay protection"
msgstr "重放保护"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:340
#: 1c13b01049cd4f80a58e36e02b68bb43
msgid ""
"The handshake exchanges a random session nonce, and every encrypted line "
"on the wire carries it plus a per-connection sequence number: ``<sender-"
"nonce>|<seq>|<ciphertext>``. The receiver drops a line whose nonce does "
"not match the current session (ciphertext replayed from an older "
"connection) or whose sequence number is not the expected one (ciphertext "
"replayed within the session / out of order); both counters reset when the"
" socket flips to encrypted mode after a (re-)exchange."
msgstr ""
"握手交换随机会话随机数，线路上的每条加密线路都携带它加上每个连接的序列号：``<sender-"
"nonce>|<seq>|<ciphertext>``。接收方丢弃随机数与当前会话不匹配的行（从旧连接重播的密文）或其序列号不是预期的行（会话内重播的密文/乱序）；当套接字在（重新）交换后切换到加密模式时，两个计数器都会重置。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:349
#: f29ce72cd71e4c4db2d5e7bbbc69679e
msgid "Decode verification and key rotation"
msgstr "解码验证和密钥轮换"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:351
#: 56a8e3632e25475d8fb35f7cd5c00cb3
msgid ""
"Every encrypted plaintext carries the fixed suffix ``_VALID`` (separated "
"by ``_``). If a message cannot be decrypted, or the suffix is missing, "
"the socket drops out of encrypted mode, the local key is reloaded, and a "
"forced ``/crypto_key_exchange`` restarts the handshake so both sides re-"
"push their current public keys. The re-exchange itself re-runs the TOFU "
"check: a peer whose key did not change is accepted again, while a peer "
"presenting a *different* key for a recorded endpoint is rejected (see the"
" TOFU section above). A user who intentionally rotates a keypair must "
"delete the stale ``pub_key.json`` entry (or the whole file) on the peer "
"side to re-trust the new key."
msgstr ""
"每个加密明文都带有固定后缀“_VALID”（用“_”分隔）。如果消息无法解密，或者后缀丢失，则套接字退出加密模式，重新加载本地密钥，并强制“/crypto_key_exchange”重新启动握手，以便双方重新推送其当前的公钥。重新交换本身会重新运行"
" TOFU 检查：密钥未更改的对等点将再次被接受，而为记录的端点提供“不同”密钥的对等点将被拒绝（请参阅上面的 TOFU "
"部分）。故意轮换密钥对的用户必须删除对等端过时的“pub_key.json”条目（或整个文件）才能重新信任新密钥。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:362
#: 3ec7554f1e91462f9a43ef664a821776
msgid ""
"Re-exchanges are circuit-broken: after ``MAX_DECODE_FAILURES`` (3) "
"consecutive decode failures the connection is closed instead of re-"
"exchanging, so a garbage-injection or persistent-mismatch storm cannot "
"spin the loop forever. A successful decryption resets the counter."
msgstr "重新交换是断路的：在“MAX_DECODE_FAILURES”（3）连续解码失败之后，连接被关闭而不是重新交换，因此垃圾注入或持久不匹配风暴不能永远旋转循环。成功解密会重置计数器。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:370
#: a0637948a1134cfa82a55ed784e05830
msgid "TCP Client command API"
msgstr "TCP 客户端命令 API"

