msgstr "TCP 客户端包含一个文件传输子系统，支持客户端到服务器和服务器到客户端传输，使用与服务器相同的底层协议。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Client_APIs.rst:542
#: 6b9b4a1098674e04bb7fad66df668050
msgid ""
"As with the server documentation, only the list of APIs is provided here."
" For detailed internal flow, please refer to the server documentation or "
